# Exchange record 0002-progress.json binds the SHA-256 of the file below, so its 543 trailing
# tabs may be neither rewritten nor removed. This single exact path is therefore exempt from the
# blank-at-eol check. It is not a wildcard: every current source, test, build and corrected
# evidence file — including the superseding list under R0-CORRECTION-01 — keeps the normal rules.
evidence/WP-F2-SERVICEBUS-TEST-RECONSTRUCTION-11/R0/OBLIGATION_SET_FROZEN.tsv whitespace=-blank-at-eol
